  "attach_document_to_record": {
    "description": "Link the file uploaded on THIS message (PDF or image) to an existing record (blood / DEXA / microbiome / DUTCH / RMR test) as its source document, REPLACING any previously linked file. Results are NOT changed — to also update results from a fuller report, additionally call add_blood_results. If the record already has a linked file, confirm the replacement with the user first.",
