    "description": "Update a DEXA / microbiome / DUTCH / RMR test: metadata (name, date, notes, provider/lab name, sample type, menstrual phase) and/or numeric values via \`values\` (DEXA: body_fat_pct, lean_mass_g, total_mass_kg, visceral_fat_g, etc.; RMR: rmr_kcal, rer, fuel pcts; DUTCH: cycle_day). Only provided fields change. To fix individual microbiome taxa or DUTCH hormone results, re-upload the report instead.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "type": "object",
